	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"「機動戦士ガンダムSEED C.E.73 －STERGAZER－」より“ジン タイプ インサージェント”が登場 。頭部、左肩、スカート部に特徴的なライトを装備 。ザフトの正規カラーとは異なる機体色を再現。脚部ミサイルポッドは、ミサイル弾頭が着脱可能 。突撃銃、重斬剣に加え、バズーカが付属"
		],
		"en": [
			"“Jin Type Insurgent” appears from “Mobile Suit GundamSEED C.E.73 -STERGAZER-”. Equipped with distinctive lights on the head, left shoulder, and skirt. Reproduces a different aircraft color from ZAFT's official color. Missile warheads can be attached to and removed from the leg missile pods. In addition to the assault rifle and heavy sword, a bazooka is included."
		]
	},
